  "id": "chocolate-cherry-cake",
  "name": "Chocolate-Cherry Cake",
  "subtitle": "A simple baked cake with cherry filling and chocolate frosting.",
  "description": "Combine the cherry filling, cake mix, eggs, and almond extract for a moist chocolate dessert, then finish it with frosting after baking.",
